      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吃下去之后……感觉如何Death？\n有没有觉得从身体深处涌出了热情的火焰呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3757efd5cc1e815382df9d5f1ffeff39599ec6859cf09d5a8b3e6dd60d5c0a01",
